{"category": "rule:ordinary", "end_line": 33, "file": "reference-semantics/semantics/builtins.k", "id": "reference-semantics/semantics/builtins.k:33", "keyword": "rule", "sha256": "d4c8072f0224b4363a94ae3ac318b3b18ad05c41f2b433fe526f8d020ae141b5", "start_line": 33, "text": "rule <k> #applyK(toCall(builtinV(\"list\")), (tuple(VS:ValSeq), .Vals)) => #alloc(list(VS)) ... </k>"}
