{"category": "rule:ordinary", "end_line": 178, "file": "reference-semantics/semantics/float.k", "id": "reference-semantics/semantics/float.k:178", "keyword": "rule", "sha256": "a87341fff5746e9d5194086ddc44c7ad77a84af986cfb236c0eb82e4803100b8", "start_line": 178, "text": "rule fracAcc(iCons(C:Int, R:IntSeq), A:Int) => fracAcc(R, A *Int 10 +Int (C -Int 48))"}
